ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Wang and his cousin Xiao Li meet for the first time at a family gathering. Everyone doesn't talk much because they are unfamiliar with each other, Xiao Li suddenly says, \"I am actually a special envoy from Mars, specifically coming to Earth to observe human living habits.\" He then describes some absurd \"Martian customs\", everyone laughs out loud.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Li say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Li says this because he believes he is really an envoy from Mars and wants to share his identity with his family.\nB. Xiao Li says this because he thinks talking about Mars can arouse his family's interest in science and educate everyone.\nC. Xiao Li says this because he wants to establish and strengthen connections with his family, easing the awkward atmosphere of the first meeting at the gathering.\nD. Xiao Li says this because he wants to show his imagination and creativity, making a deep impression on his family.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0010322026352159704,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e3e0d6006945d28065a8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368480827,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:41:20","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7db7ccf5a2fe4d74bf2ea898a4877763"}